docs {
  # Update Form Template

  Updates an existing form template.

  **Authentication**: API Key (X-API-Key header)

  **Request Body**:
  - `id` (UUID, required) - Form template ID
  - `school_id` (UUID, required) - School ID
  - `form_name` (string, required) - Updated form name
  - `form_type` (string, optional) - Form type
  - `fillout_form_id` (string, optional) - Updated Fillout form ID/URL
  - `due_date` (date, optional) - Updated deadline (YYYY-MM-DD format, must be >= current date)
  - `status` (string, optional) - Form status
  - `is_required` (boolean, optional) - Whether form is required
  - `display_order` (integer, optional) - Display order

  **Response 200 OK**:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "school_id": "uuid",
      "form_name": "Admission Form",
      "form_type": "school_form",
      "fillout_form_id": "www.yahoo.com",
      "due_date": "2026-01-15",
      "status": "school_default",
      "is_required": false,
      "display_order": null,
      "is_active": true,
      "created_at": "timestamp",
      "updated_at": "timestamp"
    }
  }
  ```
}

